-----------------------------+--------------------------------+\n| FLOAT                                      |                                |\n+--------------------------------------------+--------------------------------+\n| FLOAT4                                     |                                |\n+--------------------------------------------+--------------------------------+\n| FLOAT8                                     |                                |\n+--------------------------------------------+--------------------------------+\n| FOR                                        |                                |\n+--------------------------------------------+--------------------------------+\n| FORCE                                      |                                |\n+--------------------------------------------+--------------------------------+\n| FOREIGN                                    |                                |\n+--------------------------------------------+--------------------------------+\n| FROM                                       |                                |\n+--------------------------------------------+--------------------------------+\n| FULLTEXT                                   |                                |\n+--------------------------------------------+--------------------------------+\n| GENERAL                                    |                                |\n+--------------------------------------------+--------------------------------+\n| GRANT                                      |                                |\n+--------------------------------------------+--------------------------------+\n| GROUP                                      |                                |\n+--------------------------------------------+--------------------------------+\n| HAVING                                     |                                |\n+--------------------------------------------+--------------------------